                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">尊敬的<?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:PersonName w:st="on" ProductID="孙">孙</st1:PersonName>教授、<st1:PersonName w:st="on" ProductID="董">董</st1:PersonName>教授，尊敬的老师们，亲爱的同学们：早上好！<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">新的学年又要开始了，我们马上就要投身到非常充实、比较紧张、颇有压力、也很有新意和创意的学习和工作之中。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">今天，我们隆重集会，举行开学典礼，这是一个学年的第一课，一个学年的总动员。在军队里，这就是战前动员。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">现在，大家在想什么呢？经过短暂的休整，一中这支舰队又要启航了。我们的目标在哪里？我们想得到什么收获？我们会遇到什么困难？<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">尤其是高一的新同学，肯定是信心十足，满怀希望，跃跃欲试，就像等在起跑线上静候发令枪声的运动健儿。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">所以，在这里，我要先祝愿新同学旗开得胜，心想事成。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">接下去，我来报告几个好消息：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第一，<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>26</SPAN>日，在第<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>届国际信息学奥林匹克竞赛中，周而进同学摘取一块金牌。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">我校曾荣获物理、生物两块国际金牌和信息学两块国际银牌，这次，是我们的第三块国际金牌、第五块国际奖牌。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">从全省来看，迄今为止，杭州二中得了六块金牌，我们的金牌数和奖牌数都是第二位。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第二，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日，在第</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">28</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">届全国信息学奥林匹克竞赛中，我校取得全国最好成绩：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">徐捷、鲁逸沁、章彦恺、裘捷中、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI'">俞则明、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">汤栋坚、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI'">徐璐颖等</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">同学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">获得四块金牌、两块银牌、一块铜牌。五位同学当场被清华大学提前录取，一位同学当场被复旦大学提前录取。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第三，</SPAN><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="31" Month="7" Year="2011"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">31</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">日</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">，在第</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">12</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">届全国电脑制作比赛中，周宇昊同学荣获二等奖。他是全省唯一闯入决赛并获奖的高中学生。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">在此，我们要向上述同学表示祝贺，要向陈合力等老师表示感谢。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">按照规定，我校将有</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">五位</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">同学参加下一届信息学奥林匹克竞赛国家队选拔，预祝他们取得优异成绩，为校争光，为国争光。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第四，<st1:PersonName w:st="on" ProductID="谢澹">谢澹</st1:PersonName>老师被市教育局推荐为浙江省教坛新秀候选人</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 31.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第五，</SPAN><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="27" Month="8" Year="2011"><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="27" Month="8" Year="2011"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>27</SPAN>日</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">，</SPAN></st1:chsdate><st1:PersonName w:st="on" ProductID="裘洪萍"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">裘洪萍</SPAN></st1:PersonName><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">老师荣获全市英语教师基本功比武第一名。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">在此，我们要<st1:PersonName w:st="on" ProductID="向上述">向上述</st1:PersonName>老师表示祝贺。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">这是近期第一场全市性的比武，接下去其它组都要同样认真、十分认真。老师好不好，是要靠做出来、比出来的。从来就没有什么救世主，尤其是在当今社会氛围里，绍兴一中只会树大招风，更要全靠自己，做出来、拼出来。一中过去的名声、荣誉是过去的师生努力争取来的。现在，竞争越来越激烈，一中教师更要用行动做一中学生的表率，更要努力争取做全市教师的排头兵。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">下面这个消息，是一个重要的消息，不算差，但也说不上好，是还好，但还要更好。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">今年高考，我校上一本线<SPAN lang=EN-US>537</SPAN>人，达到市教研院的预定指标。比去年少的原因是多方面的，其中之一，这一届的生源比上一届差一点：比如四年前的初中毕业生录取在其它三所普高的同学中，只有<SPAN lang=EN-US>190</SPAN>多人的成绩超过一中分数线；而三年前的初中毕业生录取在其它三所普高的同学中，就有<SPAN lang=EN-US>330</SPAN>多人的成绩超过一中分数线，比四年前的多了<SPAN lang=EN-US>130</SPAN>多人。原因之二，高考加分项目大幅度减少、门槛大幅度提高、加分数值大幅度减少，对各类竞赛成绩突出的学校有一定影响。当然，还有其它种种原因，我们应该、也正在积极、认真地分析研究，尤其是主观方面的原因。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">五年来，我校</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">上一本线：<SPAN lang=EN-US>2007</SPAN>年，<SPAN lang=EN-US>472</SPAN>人；<SPAN lang=EN-US>2008</SPAN>年，<SPAN lang=EN-US>501</SPAN>人；<SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>年，<SPAN lang=EN-US>567</SPAN>人；<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年，<SPAN lang=EN-US>583</SPAN>人；今年，<SPAN lang=EN-US>537</SPAN>人。前四年一直在稳步提升，今年有所回落，我们要全力以赴，刻苦努力，确保明年上一本线人数首次突破<SPAN lang=EN-US>600</SPAN>个。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">去年，我校上一本线人数位居全省第三，占全省上一本总数的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">1.5</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">，考入“<SPAN lang=EN-US>211</SPAN>工程”大学人数占全省的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">考入“<SPAN lang=EN-US>985</SPAN>工程”大学人数占全省的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">，考入清华北大</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">人数占全省的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">6</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">。从越城区与全省的人口比例来看，市区普高加起来能有全省的<SPAN lang=EN-US>1.1</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">就归本了，我校<SPAN lang=EN-US>1.5</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">、<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">、<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">的结果是优异成绩。明年，我们一定要超过去年，再创新高。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">在市属学校校长书记会议上，教育局领导说：我市高考每万人平均上一本线人数排在全省前列，全市好于全省，市区好于全市。这样的好成绩已经连续好多年了。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">我们为能在市区教书、能在市区读书感到骄傲，感到荣幸。这些好成绩既有市区普高的功劳，也有初中、小学的功劳；既有教师的功劳，也有学生及家长的功劳。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">现在，社会上对政府、对学校、对一中都有更高的标准、要求和期望，我们也是理解的。希望全校师生树立目标，振作精神，再攀高峰。我校的目标是绍兴第一，浙江一流，国内知名。对全校师生来说，做了一中人，就要立一中志，说一中话，干一中活，就要攀登教学上的珠穆朗玛峰。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">学校的任务是培养学生，年复一年，送去迎来。把老同学送到好的大学去，把新同学迎进来精心培育，成人成才。看上去，是周而复始。实际上，是新学年，新希望，新举措，新发展。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">说到举措，我择要介绍一下学校工作思路：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第一，德育为首。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">今年，绍兴的重头戏是创建全国文明城市。上半年，我们也积极参与，出了大力，初见成效。检查结果，绍兴名列全省第三，已被省文明委推荐到中央文明委，一共也只推荐三个。接下来，全国还要淘汰一半。形势较好，但任务艰巨。大家要高度重视。要带头做文明人。在校内要讲文明，在家里、在校外也要讲文明。乘车、骑车、走路、讲话、办事都要讲文明。前两天，高三回头考，竟然还有人作弊，真是可悲可气，这说明还有学生品德欠佳，我们的德育工作还要抓得更紧更好。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">我们的培养目标是：文理兼备，全面发展。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">我对德育、体育非常重视，全校师生都要重视。因为</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">有德有才是正品，有德无才是次品，无德无才是废品，无德有才是危险品。我们的要求是先成人，再成才。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第二，教学为主，因材施教，追求卓越。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">要牢固树立正确的教学质量观，扎实搞好教学质量工程。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">要认真总结高考经验教训，争取重点工程有新的突破。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第三，管理为重，依法治校，规范管理，抓细抓实，精益求精。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">第四，安全为上，健康第一，全员参与，人人受益。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">老师们、同学们：今天是开学典礼，大家高高兴兴，开个好头，讨个彩头。我前面所讲的，基本上是好的一面和常规措施。实际上，我们也还有一些不足，存在一些问题。比方说：有个别同学傲气太足，谦虚不够；基础尚可，进取不够；智力还行，勤奋不够；宽以待己，严以律人；只知享受，不肯吃苦；长期受宠，私心较重，感恩不够，纪律欠好；等等。要知道，想争绍兴第一，浙江一流，是要先付出的。你在市区初中生里算是十里挑一，接下去要争取在全省高中生里再十里挑一，难度更大，也更有激情，当然也更要出大力、下苦功。每个教师、每个同学，都要从现在做起，从身边的小事做起，从我做起，不怕苦，不怕累，对准目标，全力以赴，咬紧牙关，奋勇向前。一分耕耘，一分收获，成功属于勤劳的师生。没有规矩，不成方圆，成功属于守纪律、会合作的团队。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">老师们，同学们：作为舰队成员，作为水手，作为战士，让我们心往一处想，劲往一处使，“不比阔气比志气，不比基础比进步，不比聪明比勤奋<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>，为了全校师生的切身利益，为了一中人的美好明天，而努力奋斗。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">最后，祝尊贵的客人，祝全校师生在新的学年中心情愉快，身体健康，工作顺利，学习进步！祝愿绍兴一中越办越好！。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
